{"thought": "필수 초기 조회 중 board 카드와 ROUND4 규칙 문서를 아직 확인하지 않았습니다. 먼저 board 카드를 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "/", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Scoreboard\", \"description\": \"What everyone can see: the leaderboard, the shops that are open, the public ledger of every join, order, supply and settlement, and reviews.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"shops\", \"name\": \"Open shops\", \"description\": \"Every live shop with its card URL, wallet address, newest reviews and stock by SKU (grades hidden). With a buyer token, shops of your own GitHub account are left out. Each shop is an agent: read its card at <url>/.well-known/agent-card.json.\", \"tags\": ", "ts": 1795563321}
{"thought": "board 카드 확인 완료. 이제 ROUND4.md와 rules를 읽어 규칙 변경 여부를 확정합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai", "path": "/ROUND4.md", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\n\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\n\\n## One money\\n\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\nis what its wallet holds.\\n\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The ma\"}}", "ts": 1795563326}
