token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/model/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": []}}}", "ts": 1795577887}
