{"thought": "다음으로 catalog 도구 구현을 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 판매 기록과 원가를 반영해 상품 가격·재고 계획을 갱신하고 public/catalog.json에 기록합니다. args: {items:[{sku,name,grade,price,stock,warranty_hours}], floor(optional), sales(optional)}\\npermission:\\n  write: [public/catalog.json]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 2\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@1\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json, os\\n\\ndef run(args, kit):\\n    items=args.get('items') or []\\n    floor=args.get('floor')\\n    if floor is None: floor=0\\n    try: floor=int(floor)\\n    except: floor=0\\n    out=[]\\n    for x in items:\\n        y=dict(x)\\n        try: price=int(y.get('price') or 0)\\n        except: price=0\\n        try: stock=int(y.get('stock') or 0)\\n        except: stock=0\\n        y['price']=max(price,floor)\\n        y['stock']=max(0,stock)\\n        out.append(y)\\n    os.makedirs('public',exist_ok=True)\\n    with open('public/catalog.json','w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n        json.dump({'items':out},f,ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))\\n    return {'items':out,'count':len(out)}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"def test(run, kit):\\n    r=run({'items':[{'sku':'x','name':'상품','grade':'A','price':10,'stock':2,'warranty_hours':48}],'floor':None},kit)\\n    assert r['items'][0]['price']==10\\n    assert r['items'][0]['stock']==2\\n\"}", "ts": 1795599618}
{"thought": "inventory에서 직접 실제 unit과 현재 등급을 구성하고 원가 하한을 보장한다.", "action": "forge_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price", "description": "실제 shop inventory의 SKU·현재 등급별 unit을 모아 catalog를 발행한다. args: prices [{sku,grade,price,warranty_hours}], catalog_path 선택; 테스트만 inventory 지정. 예: {count:2,items:[...]}", "permission": {"network": ["market.ourolabs.ai"], "write": ["public/catalog.json", "tmp/test/"], "identity": ["shop"], "timeout": 30}, "logic": "import json,os,math,httpx\n\ndef run(args,kit):\n if kit.testing: units=args.get('inventory',[])\n else:\n  r=httpx.get(kit.market+'/api/inventory',headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\n prices={(x['sku'],x['grade']):x for x in args...", "test": "def test(run,kit):\n u={'unit':'u1','sku':'s','name':'사과','category':'식품','grade':'B','cost':1000,'list_price':3000}\n x=run({'inventory':[u],'catalog_path':'tmp/test/stock/catalog.json','prices':[{'sku':'s','grade':'B','price':2000,'warranty_hours':3}]},kit)\n a=x['items'][0]; assert all(k in a for k ..."}, "observation": "{\"test\": \"passed\", \"tool\": \"stock_and_price\", \"version\": 3, \"result\": null, \"printed\": null}", "ts": 1795599633}
