{"thought": "실제 판매에서 쌀·채소·계란 등 저가 식품이 확인됐습니다. 도매 API 사용법과 공급창 조회 경로를 기존 도구에서 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실제 shop inventory의 SKU·현재 등급별 unit을 모아 catalog를 발행한다. args: prices [{sku,grade,price,warranty_hours}], catalog_path 선택; 테스트만 inventory 지정. 예: {count:2,items:[...]}\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 3\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@2\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,os,math,httpx\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n if kit.testing: units=args.get('inventory',[])\\n else:\\n  r=httpx.get(kit.market+'/api/inventory',headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n prices={(x['sku'],x['grade']):x for x in args.get('prices',[])}; groups={}\\n for u in units:\\n  key=(u.get('sku'),u.get('grade'))\\n  if not all(key) or not u.get('unit'):continue\\n  groups.setdefault(key,[]).append(u)\\n out=[]\\n for key,us in groups.items():\\n  us.sort(key=lambda x:x.get('supplied_at',0)); spec=prices.get(key,{})\\n  floor=max(math.ceil((int(u.get('cost',0))+210)/0.99) for u in us); price=max(int(spec.get('price') or us[0].get('list_price') or 0),floor)\\n  out.append({'sku':key[0],'name':us[0].get('name',key[0]),'category':us[0].get('category',''),'grade':key[1],'price':price,'stock':len(us),'units':[x['unit'] for x in us],'warranty_hours':int(spec.get('warranty_hours',0))})\\n p=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json');os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump({'items':out},f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n return {'count':len(out),'items':out}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"def test(run,kit):\\n u={'unit':'u1','sku':'s','name':'사과','category':'식품','grade':'B','cost':1000,'list_price':3000}\\n x=run({'inventory':[u],'catalog_path':'tmp/test/stock/catalog.json','prices':[{'sku':'s','grade':'B','price':2000,'warranty_hours':3}]},kit)\\n a=x['items'][0]; assert all(k in a for k in ['sku','name','grade','price','stock','units','warran", "ts": 1795602464}
{"thought": "도매 API 호출의 기존 기록을 검색합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "/api/supply"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"규칙 응답이 중간에서 잘렸으므로 재고 노화·수수료 관련 뒷부분을 확인하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/ROUND4.md\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## One money\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\\\\\\\nis what its wallet holds.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\\\\\\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\\\\\\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\\\\\\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\\\\\\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\\\\\\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\\\\\\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The market records that it broke (`broken` on the\\\\\\\\n  ledger) and does nothing else. The customer may come back and ask for its money; paying it back is the shop's own\\\\\\\\n  transfer and its own decision. Customers remember, talk to each other, and write on the forum.\\\\\\\\n- A shop whose wallet is nearly empty may file for bankruptcy: its stock is seized and the market sends what it lacks of\\\\\\\\n  the starting capital, at most twice.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Stock ages\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nIn Round 3 a shop could top the board by sitting on stock: storage \\\\\\\"}}}\\\", \\\"ts\\\": 1795578880}\"}, {\"file\": \"logs/reac", "ts": 1795602468}
