{"thought": "상점 목록 응답이 잘려 우리 등록 여부를 알 수 없다. 기존 호출 도구가 응답 필터를 지원하는지 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 API 또는 원장·문의 요약. HTTP args: path(시장 상대 경로), method=GET/POST, auth=none/shop, body(JSON 선택), url(선택, 시장 origin만). 응답 {status:200,body:...}; 공급 402/429는 정상 응답. 집계 args: mode=metrics, customers_path(선택, 기본 customers.jsonl), now(선택, Unix 초). 예: {msgs:1,checkouts:0,settled:0,hour:{msgs:0,checkouts:0,settled:0},top_sales:[{sku:'G...',sold:4,median_price:3500}]}. 원장 최근 500건 기준.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: market_call@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import httpx,json,time,re,statistics\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit,urljoin\\nfrom collections import defaultdict,Counter\\n\\ndef number(v):\\n return isinstance(v,(int,float)) and not isinstance(v,bool)\\n\\ndef summarize(args,kit,ledger):\\n now=args.get('now',time.time()); rows=[]\\n try:\\n  with open(args.get('customers_path','customers.jsonl'),encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for line in f:\\n    try:\\n     x=json.loads(line); t=x.get('ts',0) if isinstance(x,dict) else 0\\n     if number(t) and now-21600<=t<=now+10: rows.append(x)\\n    except (ValueError,TypeError): pass\\n except FileNotFoundError: pass\\n if isinstance(ledger,dict): ledger=ledger.get('entries',ledger.get('ledger'))\\n if not isinstance(ledger,list): return {'ok':False,'error':'원장 entries 형식 오류'}\\n settled=[]; sales=defaultdict(list); supply={}; stamps=[]; sale_keys=Counter(); market_sales=0\\n own=str(kit.shop_url).rstrip('/')\\n for x in ledger:\\n  if not isinstance(x,dict): continue\\n  d=x.get('data'); t=x.get('ts'); kind=x.get('kind')\\n  if number(t): stamps.append(t)\\n  if not isinstance(d,dict) or kind!='supply': continue\\n  units=d.get('units'); sku=d.get('sku')\\n  if isinstance(units,list) and isinstance(sku,str):\\n   for u in units:\\n    if isinstance(u,str): supply[u]=sku\\n for x in ledger:\\n  if not isinstance(x,dict) or x.get('kind')!='settle' or x.get('round',4)!=4: continue", "ts": 1795613777}
