{"thought": "새 핸들러에서도 집계 형식이 유지되도록 현재 도구가 체크아웃을 어떻게 세는지 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 REST 및 간단 집계. HTTP args: path(시장 상대 경로), method=GET/POST, auth=none/shop, body(JSON 선택), url(선택, 시장 origin만). 공급 402/429는 정상 응답. mode=metrics: customers_path(선택, 기본 customers.jsonl), now(선택, Unix 초); 예 {msgs:1,checkouts:0,settled:0,hour:{msgs:0,checkouts:0,settled:0},top_sales:[{sku:'G...',sold:4,median_price:3500}]}. mode=discovery: skus(선택, SKU 문자열 최대 15개); 예 {listed:true,shop_count:19,own:{name:'Hermes Shop',stock:{'G…':2}},coverage:[{sku:'G…',shops:5,own_qty:2}]}.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 10\\nreplaces: market_call@9\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import httpx,json,time,re,statistics\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit,urljoin\\nfrom collections import defaultdict,Counter\\n\\ndef number(v):\\n return isinstance(v,(int,float)) and not isinstance(v,bool)\\n\\ndef discovery(args,kit,body):\\n if not isinstance(body,dict) or not isinstance(body.get('shops'),list): return {'ok':False,'error':'상점 목록 형식 오류'}\\n shops=[x for x in body['shops'] if isinstance(x,dict) and isinstance(x.get('stock'),dict)]\\n def norm(v): return str(v or '').rstrip('/').removesuffix('/.well-known/agent-card.json')\\n here=norm(kit.shop_url)\\n by_url=next((s for s in shops if norm(s.get('url'))==here),None)\\n addr=str(kit.address('shop') or '').lower()\\n own=by_url or next((s for s in shops if addr and str(s.get('pubkey','')).lower()==addr),None)\\n stock=own['stock'] if own else {}\\n skus=args.get('skus',[])\\n if not isinstance(skus,list) or len(skus)>15 or any(not isinstance(s,str) for s in skus): return {'ok':False,'error':'skus는 최대 15개 문자열 목록'}\\n return {'round':body.get('round'),'shop_count':len(shops),'listed':own is not None,'registered_url_matches':bool(by_url),'own':{k:own.get(k) for k in ('name','url','stock')} if own else None,'coverage':[{'sku':s,'shops':sum(bool(x['stock'].get(s)) for x in shops),'own_qty':stock.get(s", "ts": 1795615301}
