 or {}\\n if not isinstance(data,dict):data={}\\n ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from')\\n cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reserv", "ts": 1795649613}
{"thought": "재배포 전에 이전 정산 카드 기록에서 맨데이트 구조와 필수 필드를 확인한다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_mandate"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"리다이렉트가 발생했으므로 시장 기본 URL 기준의 엔터티 카드 경로로 다시 조회하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4.0.0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Agent Market\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"supportedInterfaces\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolBinding\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MARKET-REST\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolVersion\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"capabilities\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"streaming\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"pushNotifications\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"extensions\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"uri\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/", "ts": 1795649895}
{"thought": "새 핸들러의 고객 로그가 기존 집계에서 결제서 발급으로 인식되도록 집계 기준을 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 REST·재고·판매 집계. HTTP: {path:'/api/restock',method:'GET'(기본) 또는 'POST',auth:'none'(기본) 또는 'shop',body:JSON 선택,url:동일 시장 origin URL 선택}; 공급 402/429는 정상 결과. {mode:'inventory',skus:['G02f9f99c']}(최대 15개, 생략 시 최대 30개 SKU 요약): balance(credits), restock(Unix 초), lots:[{sku,grade,qty,max_cost,min_cost,first_expiry,units:[{unit,cost,expires_at,supplied_at}]}]. {mode:'metrics',now:1795629729,customers_path:'customers.jsonl'}(둘 다 선택): msgs/checkouts/settled(6h), hour, top_sales(등급별 중앙가 credits), 최근 메시지, 원장 표본 범위. {mode:'discovery',skus:['G02f9f99c']}(선택): 시장 등록 여부와 해당 SKU 판매점 수. 실패는 {ok:false,error:'…'\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 11\\nreplaces: market_call@10\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import httpx,json,time,re,statistics\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit,urljoin\\nfrom collections import defaultdict,Counter\\n\\ndef num(v): return isinstance(v,(int,float)) and not isinstance(v,bool)\\ndef norm(v): return str(v or '').rstrip('/').removesuffix('/.well-known/agent-card.json').lower()\\ndef bad(msg): return {'ok':False,'error':str(msg)[:450]}\\ndef pick_skus(args):\\n skus=args.get('skus',[])\\n if not isinstance(skus,list) or len(skus)>15 or any(not isinstance(s,str) for s in skus): raise ValueError('skus: SKU 문자열 최대 15개')\\n return skus\\n\\ndef inventory(args,body):\\n skus=pick_skus(args)\\n if not isinstance(body,dict) or not num(body.get('balance')) or not isinstance(body.get('units'),list): return bad('inventory balance/units 형식 오류')\\n groups=defaultdict(list)\\n for u in body['units']:\\n  if not isinstance(u,dict) or not u.get('sku') or not u.get('grade') or not u.get('unit') or not num(u.get('cost')): return bad('inventory unit/sku/grade/cost 형식 오류')\\n  if not skus or u['sku'] in skus: groups[(u['sku'],u['grade'])].append({k:u.get(k) for k in ('unit','cost','supplied_at','expires_at')})\\n allowed=set(list(dict.fromkeys(k[0] for k in", "ts": 1795649922}
