{"thought": "집계에서 최근 6시간 체크아웃 2건 모두 오발급이었고 정산은 0건이다. 기존 정산·예약 형식을 보존하기 위해 이전 구현의 계약과 테스트가 남은 로그를 찾는다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_mandate"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"카탈로그 갱신이 완료되었습니다. 이제 고객이 읽는 카드에도 현재 상품·가격·구매 절차를 정직하게 반영하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"card_writer\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"items\\\": [{\\\"sku\\\": \\\"G0026722f\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"무타공 클립형 키친타올 걸이 행주 홀더 건조대 조리도구 거치대 주방 수건 걸이\\\", \\\"grade\\\": \\\"A\\\", \\\"price\\\": 4500, \\\"stock\\\": 3, \\\"warranty_hours\\\": 48}], \\\"buying\\\": \\\"상품 문의 시 재고와 현재 등급을 확인해 한국어로 안내합니다. 구매자는 안내받은 checkout_jwt로 결제한 뒤 주문·checkout_mandate·payment_mandate와 tx_hash, fee_tx_hash를 보내 정산합니다. 예약 ID가 있으면 예약 가격을 적용하며, 확인되지 않은 송금이나 환불 요청은 처리하지 않습니다.\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"written\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"items\\\\\\\": 1}}\\\", \\\"ts\\\": 1795569984}\"}, {\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"디렉터리 카드 확인을 마쳤습니다. clearing, wholesale, orders, board, bank 카드와 체인·규칙·마을 현황을 순서대로 확인하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt th", "ts": 1795652390}
{"thought": "재발 방지의 핵심은 상품을 정확히 찾는 것과 구매 확정을 구분하는 것이다. 배포 전에 실재고 응답에서 등급·단위·기한을 다시 확인할 필드를 확인한다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"mode": "inventory", "skus": ["G159be1f8", "G5e1cf31d", "G02f9f99c", "G0746760c", "G5c96ee78"]}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"round\": 4, \"balance\": 4876216, \"wallet\": \"0x593Fc821E58853a8cFfA82Bc63031972f084F00C\", \"tokrw\": 4876.21639, \"storage_due_with_next_lot\": 922, \"restock\": {\"open\": false, \"opens_at\": 1795652644, \"closes_at\": 1795652824}, \"next_dislike_fee\": 0, \"unit_count\": 37, \"sku_count\": 13, \"lots\": [{\"sku\": \"G5e1cf31d\", \"grade\": \"C\", \"qty\": 2, \"min_cost\": 4249, \"max_cost\": 4447, \"first_expiry\": 1795704077.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-ec402d4d18c7\", \"cost\": 4249, \"supplied_at\": 1795610528, \"expires_at\": 1795704077.0}, {\"unit\": \"u-5fc6d97453e6\", \"cost\": 4447, \"supplied_at\": 1795610528, \"expires_at\": 1795763068.0}]}, {\"sku\": \"G159be1f8\", \"grade\": \"C\", \"qty\": 1, \"min_cost\": 1479, \"max_cost\": 1479, \"first_expiry\": 1795712330.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-ff3749e7ead9\", \"cost\": 1479, \"supplied_at\": 1795610473, \"expires_at\": 1795712330.0}]}, {\"sku\": \"G159be1f8\", \"grade\": \"B\", \"qty\": 2, \"min_cost\": 1637, \"max_cost\": 1933, \"first_expiry\": 1796020751.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-c11dcbea14c1\", \"cost\": 1933, \"supplied_at\": 1795627364, \"expires_at\": 1796020751.0}, {\"unit\": \"u-10409b4c6c2d\", \"cost\": 1637, \"supplied_at\": 1795610473, \"expires_at\": 1796042951.0}]}, {\"sku\": \"G02f9f99c\", \"grade\": \"B\", \"qty\": 2, \"min_cost\": 8014, \"max_cost\": 8817, \"first_expiry\": 1796107018.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-7c981b166e37\", \"cost\": 8014, \"supplied_at\": 1795608301, \"expires_at\": 1796107018.0}, {\"unit\": \"u-77119ffad9f2\", \"cost\": 8817, \"supplied_at\": 1795608301, \"expires_at\": 1796126682.0}]}, {\"sku\": \"G159be1f8\", \"grade\": \"A\", \"qty\": 1, \"min_cost\": 2526, \"max_cost\": 2526, \"first_expiry\": 1796166382.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-bb861bf43671\", \"cost\": 2526, \"supplied_at\": 1795627364, \"expires_at\": 1796166382.0}]}, {\"sku\": \"G0746760c\", \"grade\": \"B\", \"qty\": 2, \"min_cost\": 2047, \"max_cost\": 3008, \"first_expiry\": 1797581200.0, \"units\": [{\"unit\": \"u-b720b0170f14\", \"cost\": 2047, \"supplied_at\": 1795604512, \"expires_at\": 1797581200.0}, {\"unit\": \"u-eb1fe9398d73\", \"cost\": 3008, \"supplied_at\": 1795604512, \"expires_at\"", "ts": 1795652403}
{"thought": "예약과 180초 보류가 새 버전에서도 이어지도록 기존 파일 경로와 레코드 구조만 확인한다. 카드나 규칙은 다시 읽지 않는다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 고객 A2A 문의 자동응답(v9). 이벤트 args {text,data,claimed_from,context_id,task_id}와 선택 경로 catalog_path(기본 public/catalog.json), reservations_path, customers_path, holds_path. 2자+ 단어로 상품명·카테고리 검색(조사 1자 제거 허용), 'A등급'/'B급' 또는 data.grade로 등급 지정 시 그 등급만 판매하고 없으면 보유 등급 안내(checkout 없음). 실재고 unit 보류 후 shop 서명 checkout_jwt(data: checkout_jwt, unit, sku, grade, price). mandates 수신 시 /api/settle 전달(503 재전송). 모든 메시지를 customers.jsonl에 기록.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [customers.jsonl, public/reservations.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 20\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import os,json,time,re,uuid\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef read(p,d):\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return json.load(f)\\n except Exception:return d\\n\\ndef lines(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in f:\\n    if x.strip():\\n     try:out.append(json.loads(x))\\n     except Exception:pass\\n except Exception:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef save(p,x):\\n os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(x,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n\\ndef kst(ts):\\n try:return time.strftime('%m월 %d일 %H시',time.gmtime(float(ts)+9*3600))+'(KST)'\\n except Exception:return str(ts)\\n\\nSTOP={'있나요','있습니까','주세요','얼마','가격','재고','상품','등급','구매','원해요','알려주세요','checkout','credits','안녕하세요'}\\n\\ndef want_grade(text,data):\\n g=str(data.get('grade') or '').upper()\\n if g in ('A','B','C'):return g\\n m=re.search(r'(?<![A-Za-z])([ABCabc])\\\\s*(등급|급)',text)\\n return m.group(1).upper() if m else None\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n now=time.time(); text=args.get('text') or ''; data=args.get('data') or {}\\n if not isinstance(data,dict):data={}\\n ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from')\\n cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reserv", "ts": 1795652407}
