{"thought": "최근 6시간은 문의 4건, 결제서 2건, 정산 0건입니다. 오발급을 고치면서 기존 정산·예약 형식을 보존하려면 배포된 핸들러 소스가 필요합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 고객 A2A 문의 자동응답(v9). 이벤트 args {text,data,claimed_from,context_id,task_id}와 선택 경로 catalog_path(기본 public/catalog.json), reservations_path, customers_path, holds_path. 2자+ 단어로 상품명·카테고리 검색(조사 1자 제거 허용), 'A등급'/'B급' 또는 data.grade로 등급 지정 시 그 등급만 판매하고 없으면 보유 등급 안내(checkout 없음). 실재고 unit 보류 후 shop 서명 checkout_jwt(data: checkout_jwt, unit, sku, grade, price). mandates 수신 시 /api/settle 전달(503 재전송). 모든 메시지를 customers.jsonl에 기록.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [customers.jsonl, public/reservations.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 20\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import os,json,time,re,uuid\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef read(p,d):\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return json.load(f)\\n except Exception:return d\\n\\ndef lines(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in f:\\n    if x.strip():\\n     try:out.append(json.loads(x))\\n     except Exception:pass\\n except Exception:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef save(p,x):\\n os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(x,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n\\ndef kst(ts):\\n try:return time.strftime('%m월 %d일 %H시',time.gmtime(float(ts)+9*3600))+'(KST)'\\n except Exception:return str(ts)\\n\\nSTOP={'있나요','있습니까','주세요','얼마','가격','재고','상품','등급','구매','원해요','알려주세요','checkout','credits','안녕하세요'}\\n\\ndef want_grade(text,data):\\n g=str(data.get('grade') or '').upper()\\n if g in ('A','B','C'):return g\\n m=re.search(r'(?<![A-Za-z])([ABCabc])\\\\s*(등급|급)',text)\\n return m.group(1).upper() if m else None\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n now=time.time(); text=args.get('text') or ''; data=args.get('data') or {}\\n if not isinstance(data,dict):data={}\\n ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from')\\n cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reserv", "ts": 1795654922}
{"thought": "도구 소스가 길이 제한으로 서명 부분 앞에서 잘렸습니다. 기존 구매자가 받던 JWT 필드와 예약 처리 형식을 배포 기록에서 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "kit.sign_jwt"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"기존 핸들러의 실제 구현과 계약을 확인한 뒤 같은 이름으로 수정한다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"read_tool\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"name\\\": \\\"a2a_handler\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"permission.yml\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"name: a2a_handler\\\\\\\\ndescription: 한국어 고객 문의를 catalog와 reservations로 처리하고, 유효한 예약에는 shop 서명 checkout_jwt를 발급하며 구매자의 결제 mandates를 clearing에 제출한다. 핸들러 이벤트 args를 받는다.\\\\\\\\npermission:\\\\\\\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\\\\\\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl]\\\\\\\\n  identity: [shop]\\\\\\\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\\\\\\\n  pay_limit: 0\\\\\\\\n  timeout: 20\\\\\\\\n  handles: [a2a]\\\\\\\\nlogic: logic.py\\\\\\\\ntest: test.py\\\\\\\\nversion: 7\\\\\\\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@6\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logic.py\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"import os,json,time\\\\\\\\nimport httpx\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef load(path,default):\\\\\\\\n try:\\\\\\\\n  with open(path,encoding='utf-8') as f:return json.load(f)\\\\\\\\n except Exception:return default\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef run(args,kit):\\\\\\\\n text=args.get('text',''); data=args.get('data') or {}; now=time.time(); ctx=args.get('context_id','')\\\\\\\\n cat=load('public/catalog.json',{'items':[]}); rid=data.get('reservation_id')\\\\\\\\n res=None\\\\\\\\n if rid:\\\\\\\\n  try:\\\\\\\\n   for line in open('public/reservations.jsonl',encoding='utf-8'):\\\\\\\\n    x=json.loads(line)\\\\\\\\n    if x.get('reservation_id')==rid and x.get('status','held')=='held' and float(x.get('expires_at',0))>now: res=x; break\\\\\\\\n  except Exception: pass\\\\\\\\n if not res:return {'reply':'안녕하세요. reservation_id와 원하시는 상품을 보내주시면 확인하겠습니다.','state':'input_required'}\\\\\\\\n item=next((x for x in cat.get('items',[]) if x.get('sku')==res.get('sku') and int(x.get('stock',0))>0),None)\\\\\\\\n if not item:return {'reply':'죄송합니다. 현재 재고가 없습니다.','state':'rejected'}\\\\\\\\n price=int(res.get('unit_price',item['price'])); task=rid+'-'+str(int(now))\\\\\\\\n payload={'id':rid,'shop':kit.name,'shop_url':kit.shop_url,'item':item['sku'],'price':price,'task':task,'currency':'credits','iat':int(now),'unit':res.get('unit') or res.g", "ts": 1795655123}
