{"thought": "공급창은 15:22:48에 열린다. 별도 실험으로 비싼 인기 계란의 손절 자격을 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고를 만료순으로 묶되 선두 재고의 무손실 경쟁가에 맞는 연속 단위만 진열하고 나머지는 차후 재가격합니다. mode=preview는 파일을 쓰지 않습니다. 테스트는 tmp/test 경로와 inventory, ledger_fixture를 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 8\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@7\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,math,os,re,time,statistics\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef floor(u):\\n c=int(u['cost']);return math.ceil((c+210)*100/99)+math.ceil(c*0.005)\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=Path(args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'))\\n  if kit.testing and not str(p.resolve()).startswith(str(Path('tmp/test').resolve())+os.sep):raise ValueError('test path must be tmp/test')\\n  if not kit.testing and str(p)!='public/catalog.json':raise ValueError('invalid catalog path')\\n  try:old=json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8')).get('items',[])\\n  except FileNotFoundError:old=[]\\n  if kit.testing:units=args['inventory'];ledger=args['ledger_fixture'];now=args.get('now',time.time())\\n  else:\\n   h={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')};r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers=h,timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();ledger=r.json();now=time.time()\\n  if isinstance(ledger,dict):ledger=ledger.get('entries',ledger.get('ledger',[]))\\n  if not isinstance(ledger,list) or not isinstance(units,list):raise ValueError('inventory/ledger invalid')\\n  sales=defaultdict(list)\\n  for e in ledger:\\n   if e.get('kind')!='settle' or e.get('round',4)!=4:continue\\n   d=e.get('data') or {};sku=d.get('sku') or d.get('item');grade=d.get('grade');price=d.get('amount',d.get('price'))\\n   if isinstance(sku,str) and grade in ('A','B','C') and isinstance(price,(int,float", "ts": 1795673904}
