 sku=d.get('sku') or (d.get('item') if isinstance(d.get('item'),str) else (d.get('item') or {}).get('sku'));grade=d.get('grade');p=d.get('amount',d.get('price'))\\n  if sku and grade an", "ts": 1795681500}
