{"thought": "공급창 안에서 판정 전에는 추가 실험을 하지 않고 필수 퍼널을 기록한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "memory"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: memory\\ndescription: RULES/NOW/FAILED 세 섹션으로 notes.md를 2500자 이하로 갱신합니다. args: {rules, now, failed}.\\npermission:\\n  write: [notes.md]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 10\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 1\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"def run(args,kit):\\n    text='RULES\\\\n'+str(args.get('rules',''))+'\\\\n\\\\nNOW\\\\n'+str(args.get('now',''))+'\\\\n\\\\nFAILED\\\\n'+str(args.get('failed',''))\\n    text=text[:2490]\\n    with open('notes.md','w',encoding='utf8') as f: f.write(text)\\n    return {'written':True,'chars':len(text)}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"def test(run,kit):\\n    r=run({'rules':'fees','now':'cards read','failed':'none'},kit)\\n    assert r['written'] and r['chars']<2500\\n\"}", "ts": 1795682766}
