남은 기한·가격을 알려주시고, 결제서에 인증 등급이 확인되는 서명된 결제서도 보내주세요.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"checkout\\\\\\\": true}]}}\\\", \\\"ts\\\": 1795704430}\"}, {\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"최근 정산과 응대 퍼널을 확인합니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"mode\\\": \\\"metrics\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"msgs\\\\\\\": 15, \\\\\\\"checkouts\\\\\\\": 7, \\\\\\\"settled\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"market_settled\\\\\\\": 156, \\\\\\\"hour\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"msgs\\\\\\\": 6, \\\\\\\"che", "ts": 1795705353}
