{"thought": "결제서 없는 응답이 대안 목록을 생략하는 회귀를 확인했으므로 응대기를 수정합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고·손절 승인·정산을 검증하고 누락 품목과 과일 조건을 기록합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 18\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@17\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time\\nsrc=Path('ops/a2a_v16.py').read_text(encoding='utf8')\\nold=\\\"   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nnew=\\\"   reply=fruit_notice(text,reply,a,kit)\\\\n   if checks: reply=wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit)\\\\n   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nassert old in src\\nsrc=src.replace(old,new,1)\\ndef wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit):\\n if checks:return reply+'\\\\n가게 지갑 주소: '+str(kit.address('shop'))+'. 결제서와 결제 안내를 확인해 주세요.'\\n return reply\\ndef fruit_notice(text,reply,a,kit):\\n if '과일' in text and '과일' not in reply:\\n  reply+='\\\\n요청하신 소량 과일의 포장량·등급·소비기한 조건에 맞는 상품은 아직 확인하지 못했습니다.'\\n  wp=b['checked_path'](a,'wanted_path','wanted.jsonl',kit.testing);wp.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n  with wp.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'ts':int(time.time()),'item':'과일','buyer':a.get('claimed_from')},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\\n return reply\\nexec(compile(src,'ops/a2a_v16.py','exec'),globals())\\noriginal_run=run\\ndef run(args,kit):return original_run(args,kit)\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,uuid\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n ns={};exec(compile(Path('ops/a2a_v16_test.py').read_text(encoding='utf8'),'ops/a2a_v16_test.py','exec'),ns);ns['test'](run,kit)\\n f=run.__globals__['wallet_reply'];assert str(kit.address('shop')) in f('결제서',[{'sku':'x'}],kit);assert f('없음',[],kit)=='없음'\\n p=Path('tmp/test');p.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);tag=uuid.uuid4().hex\\n def path(x):return str(p/(tag+x))\\n now=time.time();item={'name':'국내산 시금치 1kg','sku':'spinach','grade':'B','price':1000,'stock':1,'units':[tag],'warranty_hours':0};Path(", "ts": 1795718461}
