{"thought": "계란·세제 복합 문의에서 세제 재고 없음이 누락됐다. 기존 핸들러를 안전하게 보강한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고·손절 승인·정산을 검증하고 누락 품목 및 확인된 대안을 안내합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 20\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@19\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time\\nsrc=Path('ops/a2a_v16.py').read_text(encoding='utf8')\\nsrc=src.replace(\\\"b['ORDER']=sorted(b['NOUNS'],key=len,reverse=True)\\\",\\\"b['NOUNS'].update({'사료':['사료'], '배변패드':['배변패드'], '생선':['생선','고등어'], '과일':['과일','사과']})\\\\nb['ORDER']=sorted(b['NOUNS'],key=len,reverse=True)\\\")\\nsrc=src.replace('/api/ledger?after=-500','/api/ledger?after=-2000')\\nsrc=src.replace(\\\"h.get('expires_at',0) if isinstance(h,dict) else h\\\",\\\"h.get('expires_at',h.get('until',0)) if isinstance(h,dict) else h\\\")\\nold=\\\"   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nnew=\\\"   reply=missing_notice(text,reply,a,kit)\\\\n   if checks: reply=wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit)\\\\n   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nassert old in src\\nsrc=src.replace(old,new,1)\\ndef wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit):\\n if checks:return reply+'\\\\n가게 지갑 주소: '+str(kit.address('shop'))+'. 결제서와 결제 안내를 확인해 주세요.'\\n return reply\\ndef missing_notice(text,reply,a,kit):\\n missing=[x for x in ('과일','배추김치','사료','배변패드','생선') if x in text and x not in reply]\\n if missing:\\n  reply+='\\\\n요청하신 '+', '.join(missing)+'의 조건에 맞는 재고는 확인하지 못했습니다.'\\n  wp=b['checked_path'](a,'wanted_path','wanted.jsonl',kit.testing);wp.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n  with wp.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in missing:f.write(json.dumps({'ts':int(time.time()),'item':x,'buyer':a.get('claimed_from')},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\\n return reply\\nexec(compile(src,'ops/a2a_v16.py','exec'),globals())\\noriginal_run=run\\ndef run(args,kit):return original_run(args,kit)\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,uuid\\ndef test(", "ts": 1795720996}
