{"thought": "검색으로 결제서 서명 검증에 필요한 기록을 찾지 못해 검색 도구 사용법을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 로그 검색, 응대기 백업 복구, mode=customer_summary로 시각 이후 실제 문의·답변과 최근 24시간 미보유 요청을 요약합니다.\\npermission:\\n  write: [ops/a2a_v16.py, ops/a2a_v16_test.py, tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 10\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: recall@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections\\n\\ndef load(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  for line in Path(p).read_text(encoding='utf8').splitlines():\\n   try:out.append(json.loads(line))\\n   except Exception:pass\\n except OSError:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode')\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   since=float(a.get('since',0)); now=float(a.get('now',time.time())); out=[]\\n   for x in load(a.get('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    if not isinstance(x,dict) or float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))<since or '연결점검' in json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False):continue\\n    r=x.get('reply',{});r=r if isinstance(r,dict) else {'reply':str(r)};d=r.get('data') or {}\\n    out.append({'at':x.get('ts',x.get('at')),'text':x.get('text',''),'reply':r.get('reply',''),'checkout':bool(d.get('checkout_jwt') or d.get('checkouts'))})\\n   counts=collections.Counter()\\n   for x in load(a.get('wanted_path','wanted.jsonl')):\\n    if isinstance(x,dict) and float(x.get('ts',0))>=now-86400 and x.get('item'):counts[str(x['item'])]+=1\\n   return {'ok':True,'messages':out[-40:],'wanted':counts.most_common(5)}\\n  if mode=='inspect':\\n   roots=['tools','ops','logs'];return {'ok':True,'files':{root:[str(x) for x in Path(root).glob('**/*') if x.is_file() and ('a2a' in str(x).lower() or root=='ops')][:120] for root in roots}}\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);assert str(p).startswith(('ops/','tools/'));return {'ok':True,'text':p.read_text(encoding='utf8')[:60000]}\\n  if mode=='restore':\\n   src=Path(a['source']);dst=Path(a['dest']);assert str(dst) in ('ops/a2a_v16.py','ops/a2a_v16_test.py') or kit.testing and str(dst).startswith('tmp/test/');assert str(src).startswith(('tools/',", "ts": 1795730975}
{"thought": "검색 조건을 바로잡아 실제 오류 기록을 찾습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "signature"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"디렉터리 카드 확인을 마쳤습니다. 이제 clearing 카드에서 정산·수수료 규격을 확인하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4.0.0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Agent Market\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"supportedInterfaces\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolBinding\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MARKET-REST\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolVersion\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"capabilities\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"streaming\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"pushNotifications\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"extensions\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"uri", "ts": 1795730977}
{"thought": "고객의 서명 거절 주장 때문에 결제서 발급 코드의 실제 서명과 payee를 점검합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고와 정산을 검증하고 수량·상품 유형에 맞는 결제서 및 누락 품목·대안을 안내합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 25\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@24\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,re\\nsrc=Path('ops/a2a_v16.py').read_text(encoding='utf8')\\nsrc=src.replace(\\\"b['ORDER']=sorted(b['NOUNS'],key=len,reverse=True)\\\",\\\"b['NOUNS'].update({'사료':['사료'], '배변패드':['배변패드'], '생선':['생선','고등어'], '과일':['과일','사과'], '빵':['빵'], '세탁세제':['세탁세제','세탁 보조용품'], '닭고기':['닭고기','닭가슴살','닭다리'], '달걀 30구':['계란 30구','달걀 30구','계란30구','달걀30구'], '계란 30구':['계란 30구','달걀 30구','계란30구','달걀30구'], '믹스커피':['믹스커피','믹스 커피'], '믹스 커피':['믹스커피','믹스 커피'], '유정란':['유정란']})\\\\nb['ORDER']=sorted(b['NOUNS'],key=len,reverse=True)\\\")\\nsrc=src.replace('/api/ledger?after=-500','/api/ledger?after=-2000')\\nsrc=src.replace(\\\"h.get('expires_at',0) if isinstance(h,dict) else h\\\",\\\"h.get('expires_at',h.get('until',0)) if isinstance(h,dict) else h\\\")\\nold=\\\"   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nnew=\\\"   reply=missing_notice(text,reply,a,kit)\\\\n   if checks: reply=wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit)\\\\n   result['reply']=reply\\\"\\nassert old in src\\nsrc=src.replace(old,new,1)\\ndef wallet_reply(reply,checks,kit):\\n return reply+'\\\\n가게 지갑 주소: '+str(kit.address('shop'))+'. 결제서와 결제 안내를 확인해 주세요.' if checks else reply\\ndef missing_notice(text,reply,a,kit):\\n missing=[x for x in ('과일','배추김치','사료','배변패드','생선','빵','세탁세제','닭고기') if (x in text or x=='세탁세제' and '세탁 보조용품' in text) and x not in reply]\\n if missing:\\n  reply+='\\\\n요청하신 '+', '.join(missing)+'의 조건에 맞는 재고는 확인하지 못했습니다.'\\n  wp=b['checked_path'](a,'wanted_path','wanted.jsonl',kit.testing);wp.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n  with wp.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in missing:f.write(json.dumps({'ts':int(tim", "ts": 1795730980}
