in d for k in ('payment_mandate','checkout_mandate','tx_hash','fee_tx_hash')) or bool(re.search(r'환불|파손|보증\\\\s*청구',text))\\n  if not payment:\\n   requests=b['wanted'](text);repl", "ts": 1795734794}
