0시간. 결제서 180초 보류.\", \"checkout\": true}, {\"at\": 1795737827, \"text\": \"안녕하세요. 집에서 먹을 계란이랑 두유, 갈비찜용 돼지고기를 찾고 있어요. 계란은 안내하신 한계란 20구가 실제로 있으면 등급·남은 기한·가격을 확인해 주세요. 두유나 갈비찜용 돼지고기도 있으면 상품명, 용량이나 중량, 등급, 남은 기한과 가격을 알려주시고, 살 수 있는 품목은 유효한 서명 결제서도", "ts": 1795738002}
{"thought": "최근 문의에서 인증서 등급 조건과 구매 보류 의사를 무시한 응대가 보여 핸들러를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고·등급과 인증서 조건을 확인하고 결제서를 발급합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 30\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@29\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport re\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/a2a_handler@29/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/a2a_handler/logic.py')\\ns=p.read_text(encoding='utf8')\\nneedle=\\\"src=src.replace(base,base+'\\\\\\\\n'+patch,1)\\\"\\nassert needle in s\\ns=s.replace(needle,\\\"patch += \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nsrc=src.replace('for u in units:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n','for u in units:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n       if cert_required(text) and ((u.get(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"cert\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") or {}).get(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"cert\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") or {}).get(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"grade\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") != u.get(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"grade\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"):continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n')\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\"+needle,1)\\nexec(compile(s,str(p),'exec'),globals())\\ndef cert_required(text):\\n return bool(re.search(r'인증서',text) and re.search(r'등급|grade',text,re.I) and re.search(r'명시|표시|명확|같은|null|조건',text,re.I))\\nb['cert_required']=cert_required\\n_previous_run=run\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n r=_previous_run(a,kit)\\n if cert_required(str(a.get('text') or '')) and not (r.get('data') or {}).get('checkouts') and not any(k in (a.get('data') or {}) for k in ('payment_mandate','checkout_mandate','tx_hash','fee_tx_hash')):\\n  reply=r.get('reply','')\\n  reply=re.sub(r'([^\\\\n.]+?)(?:은\\\\(는\\\\)|은|는) 없습니다',r'\\\\1의 인증서 등급 조건에 맞는 재고는 없습니다',reply)\\n  r['reply']=reply+'\\\\n재고의 현재 등급과 도매 원본 인증서의 등급은 다를 수 있습니다. 인증서에 현재 등급이 명시된 상품만 결제서로 드립니다.'\\n return r\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,uuid\\n\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n p=Path('tools/.deprecated/a2a_handler@29/test.py')\\n if not p.exists():p=Path('tools/a2a_handler/test.py')\\n ns={};exec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),ns);ns['test'](run,kit)\\n tag=uuid.uuid4().hex;root=Path('", "ts": 1795738005}
