('unit') or u['unit'] not in allowed or u['unit'] in used:continue\\n       if tm(u.get('expires_at')) and tm(u['expires_at'])<=t:continue\\n       if x['price']<math.ceil((int(u.get('cost',0))+210)*100", "ts": 1795742815}
