{"thought": "정확한 도매 및 재고 호출 형식을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 API 및 scan/metrics/metrics_full/inventory/review/a2a. mode=inventory_units, sku로 원본 단위 확인.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai, trycloudflare.com]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 90\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 17\\nreplaces: market_call@16\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_old_units_run=run\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n if a.get('mode')!='inventory_units':return _old_units_run(a,kit)\\n try:\\n  sku=a.get('sku');assert isinstance(sku,str) and sku\\n  inv=a['inventory_fixture'] if kit.testing else req(kit,'/api/inventory',True)\\n  return {'ok':True,'units':[u for u in inv.get('units',[]) if u.get('sku')==sku]}\\n except Exception as e:return {'ok':False,'error':str(e)}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n p=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/test.py')\\n if not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/test.py')\\n ns={};exec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),ns);ns['test'](run,kit)\\n r=run({'mode':'inventory_units','sku':'G1','inventory_fixture':{'units':[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'},{'sku':'G2','unit':'u2'}]}},kit)\\n assert r['ok'] and r['units']==[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'}],r\\n\"}", "ts": 1795746630}
{"thought": "가격 조정은 승인 한도와 단위별 손절 기록이 필요하므로 기존 도구 계약을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고를 만료순 진열하고 손절 승인 단위는 중간가 하한과 일일 예약 한도 안에서만 진열합니다. mode=preview는 쓰지 않습니다. 테스트는 tmp/test 경로를 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, loss_reservations.json, loss_reservations.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,math,os,re,time,statistics\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef floor(u):\\n c=int(u['cost']);return math.ceil((c+210)*100/99)+math.ceil(c*0.005)\\ndef save(p,obj):\\n p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);q=str(p)+'.next'\\n with open(q,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(obj,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n os.replace(q,p)\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=Path(args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'));rp=Path(args.get('reserve_path','loss_reservations.json'))\\n  if kit.testing:\\n   for f in (p,rp):\\n    if not str(f.resolve()).startswith(str(Path('tmp/test').resolve())+os.sep):raise ValueError('test path must be tmp/test')\\n  elif str(p)!='public/catalog.json' or str(rp)!='loss_reservations.json':raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n  try:old=json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8')).get('items',[])\\n  except FileNotFoundError:old=[]\\n  try:reservations=json.loads(rp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n  except FileNotFoundError:reservations=[]\\n  if not isinstance(reservations,list):raise ValueError('invalid reservations')\\n  if kit.testing:units=args['inventory'];ledger=args['ledger_fixture'];now=args.get('now',time.time())\\n  else:\\n   h={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')};r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers=h,timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();ledger=r.json();now=time.time()\\n  if isinstance(ledger,dict):ledg", "ts": 1795746637}
