{"thought": "점검 파일 읽기가 경로 제한으로 실패해 도구의 지원 경로를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 로그·고객 요약 및 소스 분할 조회. mode=read|customer_summary|inspect|stage_test. stage_test는 전달된 소스와 테스트를 tmp/test에 격리해 로컬 시험한다.\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 11\\nreplaces: recall@10\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections,traceback,types,uuid\\n\\ndef load(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  for l in Path(p).read_text(encoding='utf8').splitlines():\\n   try:out.append(json.loads(l))\\n   except Exception:pass\\n except OSError:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode')\\n  if mode=='stage_test':\\n   root=Path('tmp/test');root.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);p=root/('stage_'+uuid.uuid4().hex);p.mkdir()\\n   logic=a['logic'];test=a['test'];(p/'logic.py').write_text(logic,encoding='utf8');(p/'test.py').write_text(test,encoding='utf8')\\n   ns={};exec(compile(logic,'staged_logic.py','exec'),ns);ts={};exec(compile(test,'staged_test.py','exec'),ts)\\n   class K:\\n    testing=True\\n    def __getattr__(self,k):return getattr(kit,k)\\n    def sign_jwt(self,obj,role):\\n     assert role=='shop'\\n     return 'fixture.jwt.signature'\\n    def token(self,role):return 'fixture'\\n   ts['test'](ns['run'],K());return {'ok':True,'stage':str(p),'result':'passed'}\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);assert str(p).startswith(('ops/','tools/')) and '..' not in p.parts\\n   s=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));n=max(1,min(8000,int(a.get('limit',8000))));return {'ok':True,'text':s[off:off+n],'length':len(s)}\\n  if mode=='inspect':return {'ok':True,'files':{r:[str(p) for p in Path(r).glob('**/*') if p.is_file() and ('a2a' in str(p).lower() or r=='ops')][:120] for r in ['tools','ops','logs']}}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   since=float(a.get('since',0));now=float(a.get('now',time.time()));out=[]\\n   for x in load(a.get('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    if not isinstance(x,dict) or float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))<since ", "ts": 1795747382}
{"thought": "재작성에서 기존 서명·정산·로그 계약을 보존하도록 현재 핸들러 소스를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고·등급과 명시 중량 조건을 확인해 결제서를 발급하고, 확인되지 않은 중량 문의에는 사실대로 안내합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 34\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@33\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,re,time\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/a2a_handler@33/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/a2a_handler/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_prior33=run\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n text=str(a.get('text') or '')\\n data=a.get('data') if isinstance(a.get('data'),dict) else {}\\n if '취나물' in text and re.search(r'중량|무게|몇\\\\s*(?:g|그램)',text,re.I) and not re.search(r'\\\\b(?:100|200)\\\\s*g\\\\b',text,re.I) and not any(k in data for k in ('payment_mandate','checkout_mandate','tx_hash','fee_tx_hash')):\\n  try:\\n   cp=b['checked_path'](a,'catalog_path','public/catalog.json',kit.testing)\\n   cat=json.loads(cp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n   items=[x for x in cat.get('items',[]) if '취나물' in str(x.get('name','')) and int(x.get('stock',0))>0]\\n   if not items or any(not re.search(r'(?<!\\\\d)\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?\\\\s*(?:kg|g|그램|킬로그램)\\\\b',str(x.get('name','')),re.I) for x in items):\\n    msg='취나물의 실제 포장 중량은 확인되지 않아 알려드릴 수 없으며, 중량 확인 전에는 해당 결제서를 발급하지 않습니다.'\\n    try:\\n     alts=_alternatives(a,kit)\\n     if alts:msg+='\\\\n현재 재고 대안: '+' · '.join(alts)+'\\\\n남은 기한은 문의 시 확인해 드립니다.'\\n    except Exception:pass\\n    result={'reply':msg,'state':'input_required'}\\n    log=b['checked_path'](a,'customers_path','customers.jsonl',kit.testing);log.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n    with log.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'ts':time.time(),'text':text,'buyer':a.get('claimed_from'),'reply':result},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\\n    wp=b['checked_path'](a,'wanted_path','wanted.jsonl", "ts": 1795747402}
