{"thought": "공급 호출이 실패해 실제 지원 경로를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 API 및 scan/metrics/metrics_full/inventory/review/a2a. mode=inventory_units, sku로 원본 단위 확인.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai, trycloudflare.com]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 90\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 17\\nreplaces: market_call@16\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_old_units_run=run\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n if a.get('mode')!='inventory_units':return _old_units_run(a,kit)\\n try:\\n  sku=a.get('sku');assert isinstance(sku,str) and sku\\n  inv=a['inventory_fixture'] if kit.testing else req(kit,'/api/inventory',True)\\n  return {'ok':True,'units':[u for u in inv.get('units',[]) if u.get('sku')==sku]}\\n except Exception as e:return {'ok':False,'error':str(e)}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n p=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/test.py')\\n if not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/test.py')\\n ns={};exec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),ns);ns['test'](run,kit)\\n r=run({'mode':'inventory_units','sku':'G1','inventory_fixture':{'units':[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'},{'sku':'G2','unit':'u2'}]}},kit)\\n assert r['ok'] and r['units']==[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'}],r\\n\"}", "ts": 1795748856}
{"thought": "도매 카드에서 견적 API 계약을 조회합니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "wholesale"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where toke", "ts": 1795748859}
{"thought": "계란 두 개 견적이 회당 한도에 들어올 가능성이 있어 API 호출 형식을 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/logic.py"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"from pathlib import Path\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@14/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_old_run=run\\ndef full_ledger(fetch):\\n allrows=[];cursor=-5000\\n for i in range(20):\\n  page=rows(fetch(cursor))\\n  if not page:break\\n  allrows.extend(page)\\n  seqs=[x.get('seq') for x in page if isinstance(x,dict) and isinstance(x.get('seq'),int)]\\n  if not seqs:break\\n  nxt=max(seqs)\\n  if cursor>=0 and nxt<=cursor:break\\n  cursor=nxt\\n return allrows\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n if a.get('mode')!='metrics_full':return _old_run(a,kit)\\n try:\\n  if kit.testing:\\n   pages=a.get('pages_fixture'); l=full_ledger(lambda c:pages.get(str(c),[])) if pages is not None else a['ledger_fixture']\\n  else:l=full_ledger(lambda c:req(kit,'/api/ledger?after='+str(c)))\\n  logs=a.get('logs_fixture',[]) if kit.testing else getlogs(a.get('logs_path','customers.jsonl'))\\n  out=metrics(l,logs,a.get('now',time.time()),kit)\\n  return {'ok':True,**out,'last_seq':max((x.get('seq',0) for x in l if isinstance(x,dict)),default=0)}\\n except Exception as e:return {'ok':False,'error':str(e)}\", \"length\": 1144}}", "ts": 1795748862}
{"thought": "기본 API 모드의 인자를 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/.deprecated/market_call@14/logic.py"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"import json,time,statistics,uuid\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom collections import defaultdict,Counter\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef norm(v):return str(v or '').rstrip('/').lower()\\ndef rows(x):\\n if isinstance(x,list):return x\\n if isinstance(x,dict):return x.get('entries',x.get('ledger',[]))\\n return []\\ndef request(kit,path,auth=False,method='GET',body=None):\\n if not isinstance(path,str) or not path.startswith('/api/') or path.startswith('//'):raise ValueError('invalid API path')\\n r=httpx.request(method.upper(),kit.market.rstrip('/')+path,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')} if auth else {},json=body,timeout=12,follow_redirects=False)\\n try:b=r.json()\\n except Exception:b={'text':r.text[:300]}\\n return r.status_code,b\\ndef req(kit,path,auth=False):\\n s,b=request(kit,path,auth)\\n if s!=200:raise ValueError(path+' HTTP '+str(s))\\n return b\\ndef items(x,key):return x.get(key,[]) if isinstance(x,dict) else x if isinstance(x,list) else []\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))\\n except (ValueError,TypeError):return 0\\ndef sc(ledger,shops,board,catalog):\\n ss=items(shops,'shops');bb=items(board,'shops');byurl={norm(s.get('url')):s.get('name') for s in ss if isinstance(s,dict)}\\n counts=Counter();sales=defaultdict(list);names={};times=[]\\n for r in rows(ledger):\\n  if not isinstance(r,dict) or r.get('kind')!='settle' or r.get('round',4)!=4:continue\\n  d=r.get('data') or {};u=norm(d.get('shop_url') or d.get('shop'));counts[byurl.get(u) or d.get('shop') or '?']+=1\\n  sku=d.get('sku') or (d.get('item') if isinstance(d.get('item'),str) else (d.get('item') or {}).get('sku'));g=d.get('grade');p=d.get('amount',d.get('price'))\\n  if sku and g and isinstance(p,(int,float)) and p>0:sales[(sku,g)].append(p);names[sku]=d.get('name','') or names.get(sku,'')\\n  if stamp(r):times.append(stamp(r))\\n top=[{'sku':s,'grade':g,'name':names.get(s,''),'count':len(ps),'median':stat", "ts": 1795748865}
