{"thought": "기존 조회가 길이를 잘랐으므로 조회 도구의 지원 인자를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 점검 파일·고객 요약·소스 조회와 tmp/test 격리 시험. mode=read|customer_summary|inspect|stage_test, read path=harness_check.json|ops/...|tools/...\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 12\\nreplaces: recall@11\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections,traceback,uuid\\n\\ndef load(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  for line in Path(p).read_text(encoding='utf8').splitlines():\\n   try: out.append(json.loads(line))\\n   except Exception: pass\\n except OSError: pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode')\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);s=str(p)\\n   if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or not (s=='harness_check.json' or s.startswith(('ops/','tools/'))): raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n   text=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));limit=max(1,min(8000,int(a.get('limit',8000))))\\n   return {'ok':True,'text':text[off:off+limit],'length':len(text)}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   now=float(a.get('now',time.time())); since=float(a.get('since',0));out=[]\\n   for x in load(a.get('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    if not isinstance(x,dict) or float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))<since or '연결점검' in json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False):continue\\n    r=x.get('reply',{});r=r if isinstance(r,dict) else {'reply':str(r)};d=r.get('data') or {}\\n    out.append({'at':x.get('ts',x.get('at')),'text':x.get('text',''),'reply':r.get('reply',''),'checkout':bool(d.get('checkout_jwt') or d.get('checkouts'))})\\n   counts=collections.Counter(str(x['item']) for x in load(a.get('wanted_path','wanted.jsonl')) if isinstance(x,dict) and float(x.get('ts',0))>=now-86400 and x.get('item'))\\n   return {'ok':True,'messages':out[-40:],'wanted':counts.most_common(5)}\\n  if mode=='inspect':return {'ok':True,'files':{r:[str(p) for p in Path(r).glob('**/*') if p.is_file() and ('a2a' in str(p).lower() or r=='ops')][:120] for r in ['tools','ops','logs']}}\\n  ", "ts": 1795753099}
{"thought": "이전 조회 실패를 보완해 나머지 코드를 읽습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "ops/a2a_v11.py", "offset": 7600, "limit": 8000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"\\n     results.append({'checkout_jwt':jwt,'unit':uid,'price':price,'sku':x['sku'],'name':x['name'],'grade':x['grade'],'expires_at':u.get('expires_at'),'warranty_hours':x.get('warranty_hours',0),'hold_until':int(t+180)})\\n    f.seek(0);f.truncate();json.dump(holds,f,ensure_ascii=False);f.flush();fcntl.flock(f,fcntl.LOCK_UN)\\n   msg=[]\\n   for x in results:\\n    date=datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp(tm(x['expires_at']),datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(hours=9))).strftime('%m월 %d일 %H:%M KST') if tm(x['expires_at']) else '표시 없음'\\n    msg.append('%s / %s등급 / %s credits / 소비기한 %s / 보증 %s시간. 결제서 180초 보류.'%(x['name'],x['grade'],x['price'],date,x['warranty_hours']))\\n   if unavailable:msg.append('와 '.join(unavailable)+'은(는) 없습니다.')\\n   msg+=errors\\n   data={'checkouts':results}\\n   if len(results)==1:data.update(results[0])\\n   return say('\\\\n'.join(msg) or '재고를 확인하지 못했습니다.',data)\\n  result=work()\\n  log.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n  with open(log,'a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'at':int(t),'text':text,'data':d,'claimed_from':a.get('claimed_from'),'task_id':a.get('task_id'),'context_id':a.get('context_id'),'reply':result},ensure_ascii=False,default=str)+'\\\\n')\\n  return result\\n except Exception as e:\\n  try:\\n   p=checked_path(a,'customers_path','customers.jsonl',kit.testing);p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n   with open(p,'a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'at':int(t),'text':text,'error':str(e)},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\\n  except Exception:pass\\n  return {'ok':False,'error':str(e),'state':'input_required','reply':'재고 확인에 문제가 생겼습니다. 잠시 후 다시 문의해 주세요.'}\\n\", \"length\": 9201}}", "ts": 1795753102}
