{"thought": "포럼 노출이 1시간 0건이었으므로 카드 게시 주기를 10분으로 줄이는 독립 변경을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "card_writer"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: card_writer\\ndescription: 카탈로그에서 짧은 상품명과 카드 스킬을 게시하고 실제 재고와 최근 동등급 중간가를 확인해 20분 간격으로 포럼에 자동 안내합니다. 테스트 입력은 tmp/test 경로 및 ledger_fixture, inventory_fixture, forum_fixture를 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [card.json, forum_publish_state.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 45\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 7\\nreplaces: card_writer@6\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,statistics,time\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nimport httpx\\nCATS=[('side','반찬·김치',['김치','반찬','고등어']),('protein','계란·두부',['계란','두부','요거트','우유']),('vegetable','채소',['채소','나물','시금치','콩나물','고구마','사과']),('staple','쌀·차·간식',[])]\\nSHORT=[('계란','계란 20구'),('둥굴레차','둥굴레차'),('총각김치','총각김치 2kg'),('취나물','취나물'),('시금치','시금치'),('쌈채소','쌈채소'),('두부','두부'),('콩나물','콩나물'),('쌀','쌀 2kg'),('고등어','고등어'),('요거트','요거트'),('생수','생수'),('크래커','크래커'),('허브차','허브차')]\\ndef patharg(a,key,default,testing):\\n p=Path(a.get(key,default))\\n if testing:\\n  if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or p.parts[:2]!=('tmp','test'):raise ValueError('test path must be under tmp/test/')\\n elif str(p)!=default:raise ValueError('invalid production path')\\n return p\\ndef short(name):\\n for word,n in SHORT:\\n  if word in name:\\n   if word=='계란' and '20구' not in name:return '계란'\\n   if word=='쌀' and '2kg' not in name:return '쌀'\\n   if word=='총각김치' and '2kg' not in name:return '총각김치'\\n   return n\\n return name[:25]\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  cp=patharg(a,'catalog_path','public/catalog.json',kit.testing);out=patharg(a,'card_path','card.json',kit.testing);state=patharg(a,'forum_state_path','forum_publish_state.json',kit.testing)\\n  items=json.loads(cp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))['items']\\n  if not isinstance(items,list):raise ValueError('invalid catalog')\\n  products=[]\\n  for x in items:\\n   if isinstance(x,dict) and isinstance(x.get('name'),str) and x.get('name') and x.get('sku') and x.get('grade') and type(x.get('price')) is int and x['price']>", "ts": 1795756595}
{"thought": "결제서 재작성 전에 Decisions 응답 형식과 시뮬레이션 수단을 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "ops/llm_shim.py", "limit": 8000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Local OpenAI-compatible shim between the Round 4 kit and the OpenAI API.\\n\\nWhy: the kit (scripts/round4/agent_kit.py, read-only) sends `max_tokens`, which OpenAI's reasoning models\\n(gpt-5.4 and later, including gpt-6.1-sol) reject with 400 \\\"use max_completion_tokens instead\\\". The kit lets\\nagent.json point llm.base anywhere, so this shim sits on 127.0.0.1 and:\\n  - renames max_tokens to max_completion_tokens, raised to SHIM_MAX_COMPLETION (reasoning tokens count against it;\\n    the kit's 4000 would often leave no room for the answer),\\n  - adds reasoning_effort from AGENT_REASONING_EFFORT when set,\\n  - forwards to OPENAI_BASE_URL with OPENAI_API_KEY,\\n  - appends token usage (never message content) to logs/llm-shim.jsonl,\\n  - stops spending at the owner's daily_tokens (owner_limits.json, set in the app) or SHIM_DAILY_TOKENS total tokens per local day (default 15,000,000, a safety net above the ~6-8M a day expected after the 11-26 sleep rules; 0 = no cap): past the cap it\\n    answers the kit itself with a sleep move (no API call), so the agent rests until the next day instead of\\n    retrying. Customers are still answered by the a2a_handler tool, which needs no model.\\n  - FORGE ESCALATION (11-27): when the answer's move is forge_tool (the agent writing a tool's code and test, ~3% of\\n    steps but the ones that break sales when wrong), the same request goes again to SHIM_FORGE_MODEL (default\\n    gpt-6.2-sol, reasoning SHIM_FORGE_EFFORT, default medium) and that answer is returned instead. The kit gives up on\\n    a socket silent for 60 s, so the second call gets what is left of SHIM_FORGE_DEADLINE (55 s); if it fails or runs\\n    out, the first answer stands. SHIM_FORGE_MODEL= (empty) turns this off.\\n  - DECISIONS (11-27): POST /v1/decisions is passed to OpenAI's Decisions API with the key added here, so a forged\\n    tool can ask typed questions (choice/predicate/score) on 127.0.0.", "ts": 1795756601}
