{"thought": "공급창이 열려 있지만 기존 TOOLS 기록에 견적 호출 형식이 없어 먼저 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 API 및 scan/metrics/metrics_full/inventory/review/a2a. mode=inventory_units, sku로 원본 단위 확인.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai, trycloudflare.com]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 90\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 17\\nreplaces: market_call@16\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_old_units_run=run\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n if a.get('mode')!='inventory_units':return _old_units_run(a,kit)\\n try:\\n  sku=a.get('sku');assert isinstance(sku,str) and sku\\n  inv=a['inventory_fixture'] if kit.testing else req(kit,'/api/inventory',True)\\n  return {'ok':True,'units':[u for u in inv.get('units',[]) if u.get('sku')==sku]}\\n except Exception as e:return {'ok':False,'error':str(e)}\\n\", \"test.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n p=Path('tools/.deprecated/market_call@16/test.py')\\n if not p.exists():p=Path('tools/market_call/test.py')\\n ns={};exec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),ns);ns['test'](run,kit)\\n r=run({'mode':'inventory_units','sku':'G1','inventory_fixture':{'units':[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'},{'sku':'G2','unit':'u2'}]}},kit)\\n assert r['ok'] and r['units']==[{'sku':'G1','unit':'u1'}],r\\n\"}", "ts": 1795757098}
{"thought": "공급창에서 견적 계약을 확인합니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "wholesale"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where toke", "ts": 1795757101}
