{"thought": "실재고가 있는데 결제서가 0건인 결함을 수정하려면 기존 정산·서명 계약과 테스트를 확인해야 합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 실재고·등급과 명시 중량 조건을 확인해 결제서를 발급하고, 확인되지 않은 중량 문의에는 사실대로 안내합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, customer_replies.jsonl, holds.json, wanted.jsonl, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 34\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@33\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,re,time\\np=Path('tools/.deprecated/a2a_handler@33/logic.py')\\nif not p.exists():p=Path('tools/a2a_handler/logic.py')\\nexec(compile(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'),str(p),'exec'),globals())\\n_prior33=run\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n text=str(a.get('text') or '')\\n data=a.get('data') if isinstance(a.get('data'),dict) else {}\\n if '취나물' in text and re.search(r'중량|무게|몇\\\\s*(?:g|그램)',text,re.I) and not re.search(r'\\\\b(?:100|200)\\\\s*g\\\\b',text,re.I) and not any(k in data for k in ('payment_mandate','checkout_mandate','tx_hash','fee_tx_hash')):\\n  try:\\n   cp=b['checked_path'](a,'catalog_path','public/catalog.json',kit.testing)\\n   cat=json.loads(cp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n   items=[x for x in cat.get('items',[]) if '취나물' in str(x.get('name','')) and int(x.get('stock',0))>0]\\n   if not items or any(not re.search(r'(?<!\\\\d)\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?\\\\s*(?:kg|g|그램|킬로그램)\\\\b',str(x.get('name','')),re.I) for x in items):\\n    msg='취나물의 실제 포장 중량은 확인되지 않아 알려드릴 수 없으며, 중량 확인 전에는 해당 결제서를 발급하지 않습니다.'\\n    try:\\n     alts=_alternatives(a,kit)\\n     if alts:msg+='\\\\n현재 재고 대안: '+' · '.join(alts)+'\\\\n남은 기한은 문의 시 확인해 드립니다.'\\n    except Exception:pass\\n    result={'reply':msg,'state':'input_required'}\\n    log=b['checked_path'](a,'customers_path','customers.jsonl',kit.testing);log.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n    with log.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'ts':time.time(),'text':text,'buyer':a.get('claimed_from'),'reply':result},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\\n    wp=b['checked_path'](a,'wanted_path','wanted.jsonl", "ts": 1795757894}
{"thought": "정산 프로토콜과 실제 고객 재현 자료가 필요합니다. 지적된 recall 체인을 먼저 단일 파일로 교체하겠습니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 점검 파일·고객 요약·소스 조회와 tmp/test 격리 시험. mode=read|customer_summary|inspect|stage_test, read path=harness_check.json|ops/...|tools/...\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 12\\nreplaces: recall@11\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections,traceback,uuid\\n\\ndef load(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  for line in Path(p).read_text(encoding='utf8').splitlines():\\n   try: out.append(json.loads(line))\\n   except Exception: pass\\n except OSError: pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode')\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);s=str(p)\\n   if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or not (s=='harness_check.json' or s.startswith(('ops/','tools/'))): raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n   text=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));limit=max(1,min(8000,int(a.get('limit',8000))))\\n   return {'ok':True,'text':text[off:off+limit],'length':len(text)}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   now=float(a.get('now',time.time())); since=float(a.get('since',0));out=[]\\n   for x in load(a.get('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    if not isinstance(x,dict) or float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))<since or '연결점검' in json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False):continue\\n    r=x.get('reply',{});r=r if isinstance(r,dict) else {'reply':str(r)};d=r.get('data') or {}\\n    out.append({'at':x.get('ts',x.get('at')),'text':x.get('text',''),'reply':r.get('reply',''),'checkout':bool(d.get('checkout_jwt') or d.get('checkouts'))})\\n   counts=collections.Counter(str(x['item']) for x in load(a.get('wanted_path','wanted.jsonl')) if isinstance(x,dict) and float(x.get('ts',0))>=now-86400 and x.get('item'))\\n   return {'ok':True,'messages':out[-40:],'wanted':counts.most_common(5)}\\n  if mode=='inspect':return {'ok':True,'files':{r:[str(p) for p in Path(r).glob('**/*') if p.is_file() and ('a2a' in str(p).lower() or r=='ops')][:120] for r in ['tools','ops','logs']}}\\n  ", "ts": 1795757899}
{"thought": "recall에서 임의 소스를 실행하는 시험 모드를 제거하고, 읽기 전용으로 고객 원문과 점검 기록을 조회하도록 정리합니다.", "action": "forge_tool", "args": {"name": "recall", "description": "읽기 전용 점검 및 고객 기록 조회. mode=read(path,offset,limit)|customer_summary(since,now,limit)|search(word).", "permission": {"write": ["tmp/test/"], "timeout": 20}, "logic": "from pathlib import Path\nimport json,time,collections\n\ndef rows(path):\n try:\n  with Path(path).open(encoding='utf8') as f:\n   for line in f:\n    try:\n     x=json.loads(line)\n     if isinstance(x,dict):yield x\n    except ValueError:continue\n except FileNotFoundError:return\n\ndef stamp(x):\n try:return ...", "test": "from pathlib import Path\nimport json,uuid\n\ndef test(run,kit):\n p=Path('tmp/test')/uuid.uuid4().hex;p.mkdir(parents=True)\n (p/'customers').write_text(json.dumps({'ts':100,'text':'현미','reply':{'reply':'현미 B','data':{'checkouts':[1]}}})+'\\n'+json.dumps({'ts':101,'text':'연결점검'}),encoding='utf8')\n (p/'wa..."}, "observation": "{\"test\": \"passed\", \"tool\": \"recall\", \"version\": 13, \"result\": null, \"printed\": null}", "ts": 1795757927}
