{"thought": "원장은 첫 페이지만 내려와 이전 통계가 틀렸습니다. 페이지 계약과 고객 기록 형식을 확인한 뒤 market_call을 같은 이름으로 고칩니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "orders"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Order desk\", \"description\": \"Hands buyers their orders and takes their results. An order is what the market wants a buyer to buy: a category, the SKUs that serve it, a budget, and AP2 open mandates signed by the market. One open order per buyer; a new one after 20 s; an order expires 600 s after it is issued. Only a settled deal (clearing house) counts.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"get_order\", \"name\": \"Get an order\", \"description\": \"Your open order, or a new one. 429 {wait} means ask again after t", "ts": 1795763307}
