{"thought": "고객 기록을 정확히 집계하고 REVIEW 전 하네스를 읽을 수 있도록 recall의 기존 계약을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 읽기 전용 점검 및 고객 기록 조회. mode=read(path,offset,limit)|customer_summary(since,now,limit)|search(word).\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 20\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 13\\nreplaces: recall@12\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections\\n\\ndef rows(path):\\n try:\\n  with Path(path).open(encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for line in f:\\n    try:\\n     x=json.loads(line)\\n     if isinstance(x,dict):yield x\\n    except ValueError:continue\\n except FileNotFoundError:return\\n\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))\\n except (TypeError,ValueError):return 0\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode','search')\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);s=p.as_posix()\\n   if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or not (s in ('harness_check.json','public/catalog.json') or s.startswith(('ops/','tools/'))):raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n   t=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));n=max(1,min(18000,int(a.get('limit',8000))))\\n   return {'ok':True,'text':t[off:off+n],'length':len(t)}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   now=float(a.get('now',time.time()));since=float(a.get('since',0));limit=max(1,min(100,int(a.get('limit',40))));out=collections.deque(maxlen=limit)\\n   def path(key,default):\\n    if not kit.testing:return default\\n    p=Path(a.get(key,default))\\n    if not p.as_posix().startswith('tmp/test/') or '..' in p.parts:raise ValueError('invalid fixture path')\\n    return p\\n   for x in rows(path('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    t=x.get('text','')\\n    if stamp(x)<since or not t or '연결점검' in t:continue\\n    r=x.get('reply',{});r=r if isinstance(r,dict) else {'reply':str(r)};d=r.get('data') or {}\\n    out.append({'at':stamp(x),'text':t,'reply':r.get('reply',''),'checkout':bool(x.get('checkout') or d.get('checkout_jwt') or d.get('checkouts'))})\\n   c=collections.Counter(str(x['item']) for x in rows(path('wanted_path','wanted.jsonl')", "ts": 1795763321}
{"thought": "recall v13은 이미 단일 파일이므로 그대로 재사용합니다. 하네스에서 최신 보충 판정과 체크아웃 문제를 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "harness_check.json", "limit": 5000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"{\\n \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-11-27 16:00\\\",\\n \\\"replies\\\": {\\n  \\\"inquiries\\\": 19,\\n  \\\"no_checkout\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"empty_reply\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"said_missing_but_stocked\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"checkout_for_gone_unit\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"examples\\\": [\\n   {\\n    \\\"at\\\": \\\"15:02\\\",\\n    \\\"unit\\\": \\\"u-fb3ecf3d31de\\\"\\n   },\\n   {\\n    \\\"at\\\": \\\"15:24\\\",\\n    \\\"unit\\\": \\\"u-432dc1877f98\\\"\\n   },\\n   {\\n    \\\"at\\\": \\\"15:53\\\",\\n    \\\"unit\\\": \\\"u-db60025e4e00\\\"\\n   }\\n  ]\\n },\\n \\\"tools\\\": {\\n  \\\"chains\\\": [\\n   \\\"market_call\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"pay_outside_guard\\\": [],\\n  \\\"forges_24h\\\": {\\n   \\\"a2a_handler\\\": 32,\\n   \\\"recall\\\": 12,\\n   \\\"market_call\\\": 4,\\n   \\\"card_writer\\\": 2,\\n   \\\"wholesale_card\\\": 2,\\n   \\\"stock_and_price\\\": 1\\n  }\\n },\\n \\\"memory\\\": {\\n  \\\"notes_chars\\\": 1584,\\n  \\\"over_3000\\\": false\\n },\\n \\\"restock\\\": [\\n  {\\n   \\\"item\\\": \\\"계란\\\",\\n   \\\"asks_24h\\\": 42,\\n   \\\"market_b_settles_12h\\\": 80,\\n   \\\"median_b\\\": 7775,\\n   \\\"unit_cost\\\": 6822,\\n   \\\"net_margin\\\": 666,\\n   \\\"our_expired_24h\\\": 0,\\n   \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"매입 우선: 공급창마다 4~5개\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"item\\\": \\\"취나물\\\",\\n   \\\"asks_24h\\\": 12,\\n   \\\"market_b_settles_12h\\\": 79,\\n   \\\"median_b\\\": 2539,\\n   \\\"unit_cost\\\": 2007,\\n   \\\"net_margin\\\": 297,\\n   \\\"our_expired_24h\\\": 1,\\n   \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"이윤은 있지만 폐기 이력: 하루 안에 팔 만큼(2~3개)\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"item\\\": \\\"두부\\\",\\n   \\\"asks_24h\\\": 9,\\n   \\\"market_b_settles_12h\\\": 18,\\n   \\\"median_b\\\": 3025,\\n   \\\"unit_cost\\\": 2864,\\n   \\\"net_margin\\\": -79,\\n   \\\"our_expired