{"thought": "현행 핸들러의 결제서 형식을 보존할 수 있도록 기존 구현 전체와 시험 규약을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 읽기 전용 점검 및 고객 기록 조회. mode=read(path,offset,limit)|customer_summary(since,now,limit)|search(word).\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 20\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 13\\nreplaces: recall@12\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"from pathlib import Path\\nimport json,time,collections\\n\\ndef rows(path):\\n try:\\n  with Path(path).open(encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for line in f:\\n    try:\\n     x=json.loads(line)\\n     if isinstance(x,dict):yield x\\n    except ValueError:continue\\n except FileNotFoundError:return\\n\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))\\n except (TypeError,ValueError):return 0\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode','search')\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);s=p.as_posix()\\n   if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or not (s in ('harness_check.json','public/catalog.json') or s.startswith(('ops/','tools/'))):raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n   t=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));n=max(1,min(18000,int(a.get('limit',8000))))\\n   return {'ok':True,'text':t[off:off+n],'length':len(t)}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   now=float(a.get('now',time.time()));since=float(a.get('since',0));limit=max(1,min(100,int(a.get('limit',40))));out=collections.deque(maxlen=limit)\\n   def path(key,default):\\n    if not kit.testing:return default\\n    p=Path(a.get(key,default))\\n    if not p.as_posix().startswith('tmp/test/') or '..' in p.parts:raise ValueError('invalid fixture path')\\n    return p\\n   for x in rows(path('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    t=x.get('text','')\\n    if stamp(x)<since or not t or '연결점검' in t:continue\\n    r=x.get('reply',{});r=r if isinstance(r,dict) else {'reply':str(r)};d=r.get('data') or {}\\n    out.append({'at':stamp(x),'text':t,'reply':r.get('reply',''),'checkout':bool(x.get('checkout') or d.get('checkout_jwt') or d.get('checkouts'))})\\n   c=collections.Counter(str(x['item']) for x in rows(path('wanted_path','wanted.jsonl')", "ts": 1795768183}
{"thought": "12시간 이내 식품의 중간가 -10% 규칙이 실제 진열에 반영되는지 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고를 만료순 진열하고 손절 승인 단위는 중간가 하한과 일일 예약 한도 안에서만 진열합니다. mode=preview는 쓰지 않습니다. 테스트는 tmp/test 경로를 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, loss_reservations.json, loss_reservations.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,math,os,re,time,statistics\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef floor(u):\\n c=int(u['cost']);return math.ceil((c+210)*100/99)+math.ceil(c*0.005)\\ndef save(p,obj):\\n p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);q=str(p)+'.next'\\n with open(q,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(obj,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n os.replace(q,p)\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=Path(args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'));rp=Path(args.get('reserve_path','loss_reservations.json'))\\n  if kit.testing:\\n   for f in (p,rp):\\n    if not str(f.resolve()).startswith(str(Path('tmp/test').resolve())+os.sep):raise ValueError('test path must be tmp/test')\\n  elif str(p)!='public/catalog.json' or str(rp)!='loss_reservations.json':raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n  try:old=json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8')).get('items',[])\\n  except FileNotFoundError:old=[]\\n  try:reservations=json.loads(rp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n  except FileNotFoundError:reservations=[]\\n  if not isinstance(reservations,list):raise ValueError('invalid reservations')\\n  if kit.testing:units=args['inventory'];ledger=args['ledger_fixture'];now=args.get('now',time.time())\\n  else:\\n   h={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')};r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers=h,timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();ledger=r.json();now=time.time()\\n  if isinstance(ledger,dict):ledg", "ts": 1795768189}
