{"thought": "새 핸들러의 정산 전달이 기존 청산 계약과 같은지 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/logic.py", "offset": 0, "limit": 4500}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"import json,time,uuid,re,fcntl,datetime\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\nALIASES={'계란':['계란','달걀','유정란'],'둥굴레차':['둥굴레차'],'두부':['두부'],'시금치':['시금치'],'취나물':['취나물'],'총각김치':['총각김치','알타리김치'],'김치':['김치'],'우유':['우유'],'두유':['두유'],'요거트':['요거트','요구르트'],'고등어':['고등어'],'가자미':['가자미'],'생선':['생선','가자미','고등어'],'콩나물':['콩나물'],'커피':['커피','원두','드립백'],'쌀':['쌀','백미'],'생수':['생수'],'스파게티':['스파게티','파스타']}\\nWALLET='결제서는 Hermes Shop 지갑 0x593F…F00C로 서명했습니다(에이전트 카드 wallets.shop과 같음).'\\nFOOD='식품의 시장 인증서에는 등급이 없으며 식품 등급은 남은 소비기한을 따릅니다. 안내 등급은 현재 재고 기준입니다.'\\ndef path(a,k,d,testing):\\n p=Path(a.get(k,d))\\n if testing:\\n  if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or p.parts[:2]!=('tmp','test'):raise ValueError('invalid test path')\\n elif str(p)!=d:raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n return p\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x or 0)\\n except Exception:\\n  try:return datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(str(x).replace('Z','+00:00')).timestamp()\\n  except Exception:return 0\\ndef log(p,x):\\n p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n with p.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,default=str)+'\\\\n')\\ndef api(kit,p,body=None):\\n r=httpx.request('POST' if body is not None else 'GET',kit.market.rstrip('/')+p,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},json=body,timeout=8);r.raise_for_status();return r.json()\\ndef settled(x):\\n return isinstance(x,dict) and (x.get('settled') is True or x.get('status')=='settled' or x.get('state')=='settled' or settled(x.get('result')) or settled(x.get('data')))\\ndef requests(text):\\n hits=[]\\n for n,words in ALIASES.items():\\n  for w in words:\\n   for m in re.finditer(re.escape(w),text,re.I):hits.append((m.start(),m.end(),n))\\n hits.sort(key=lambda z:(z[0],z[0]-z[1]));used=[];out=[]\\n for s,e,n in hits:\\n  if any(s<y and e>x for x,y in used):continue\\n  used.append((s,e));tail=text[e:e+30]\\n  if re.match(r'\\\\s*(?:은|는|이|가)?\\\\s*(?:찾는\\\\s*게\\\\s*아니|찾지|말고|아니|안\\\\s*찾|재고\\\\s*확인이\\\\s*안)',tail):continue", "ts": 1795770547}
{"thought": "정산 필드와 응답 계약을 청산 카드로 검증합니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "clearing"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wal", "ts": 1795770551}
{"thought": "청산 카드가 payment_mandate.mandate를 요구하므로 v38의 payload 검사로는 정산이 막힙니다. 즉시 독립 파일 전체를 다시 작성하고 실제 계약을 테스트합니다.", "action": "forge_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler", "description": "실시간 재고와 DECISIONS, 카탈로그 가격으로 서명 결제서를 발급하고 mandate 정산을 전달합니다.", "permission": {"network": ["market.ourolabs.ai", "127.0.0.1"], "write": ["holds.json", "customers.jsonl", "wanted.jsonl", "tmp/test/"], "identity": ["shop"], "wallet": ["sign_jwt"], "timeout": 35, "handles": ["a2a"]}, "logic": "import json,time,uuid,re,fcntl,datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport httpx\n\nALIASES={'계란':['계란','달걀','유정란'],'둥굴레차':['둥굴레차'],'두부':['두부'],'시금치':['시금치'],'취나물':['취나물'],'총각김치':['총각김치','알타리김치'],'김치':['김치'],'우유':['우유'],'두유':['두유'],'요거트':['요거트','요구르트'],'고등어':['고등어'],'가자미':['가자미'],'생선':['생선','가자미','고등어'],...", "test": "import json,time,uuid,base64\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef test(run,kit):\n root=Path('tmp/test')/uuid.uuid4().hex;root.mkdir(parents=True);now=time.time();goods=[('G001','한계란 난각번호 1번 계란 무항생제 유정란 20구','B',7340),('G002','동서 둥굴레차 50T 60g','B',3051),('G003','실큰두부 300g','B',2793),('G004','국내산 시금치 1kg','B..."}, "observation": "{\"test\": \"passed\", \"tool\": \"a2a_handler\", \"version\": 39, \"result\": null, \"printed\": null}", "ts": 1795770609}
