{"thought": "누락 기록 조회가 실패해 경로 제한과 조회 방식을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "recall"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: recall\\ndescription: 읽기 전용 점검 및 고객 기록 조회. mode=read(path,offset,limit)|customer_summary(since,now,limit)|search(word). 고객 요약은 response_data 결제서도 집계.\\npermission:\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  timeout: 20\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 14\\nreplaces: recall@13\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import collections,json,time\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\ndef rows(path):\\n try:\\n  with Path(path).open(encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for line in f:\\n    try:\\n     x=json.loads(line)\\n     if isinstance(x,dict):yield x\\n    except ValueError:pass\\n except FileNotFoundError:return\\n\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x.get('ts',x.get('at',0)))\\n except (TypeError,ValueError):return 0\\n\\ndef checkout(x):\\n r=x.get('reply');d=[x,x.get('response_data'),r.get('data') if isinstance(r,dict) else None]\\n return any(isinstance(v,dict) and bool(v.get('checkout') or v.get('checkout_jwt') or v.get('checkouts')) for v in d)\\n\\ndef run(a,kit):\\n try:\\n  mode=a.get('mode','search')\\n  if mode=='read':\\n   p=Path(a['path']);s=p.as_posix()\\n   if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or not (s in ('harness_check.json','public/catalog.json') or s.startswith(('ops/','tools/'))):raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n   t=p.read_text(encoding='utf8');off=max(0,int(a.get('offset',0)));n=max(1,min(18000,int(a.get('limit',8000))))\\n   return {'ok':True,'text':t[off:off+n],'length':len(t)}\\n  if mode=='customer_summary':\\n   now=float(a.get('now',time.time()));since=float(a.get('since',0));limit=max(1,min(100,int(a.get('limit',40))));out=collections.deque(maxlen=limit);i=c=0\\n   def path(key,default):\\n    if not kit.testing:return default\\n    p=Path(a.get(key,''))\\n    if p.parts[:2]!=('tmp','test') or '..' in p.parts:raise ValueError('invalid fixture path')\\n    return p\\n   for x in rows(path('customer_path','customers.jsonl')):\\n    t=x.get('text','');at=stamp(x);d=x.get('data');r=x.get('reply','')\\n    if not since<=at<=now+10 or not isinstance(t,str) or not t.strip() or '연결점검' in t or isins", "ts": 1795776217}
{"thought": "핸들러 전체 로직과 테스트를 나누어 확인해 기존 기능을 보존한 안전한 수정을 준비합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/logic.py", "offset": 0, "limit": 9000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"import json,time,uuid,re,fcntl,datetime\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\nALIASES={'계란':['계란','달걀','유정란'],'둥굴레차':['둥굴레차'],'두부':['두부'],'시금치':['시금치'],'취나물':['취나물'],'총각김치':['총각김치','알타리김치'],'김치':['김치'],'우유':['우유'],'두유':['두유'],'요거트':['요거트','요구르트'],'고등어':['고등어'],'가자미':['가자미'],'생선':['생선','가자미','고등어'],'콩나물':['콩나물'],'커피':['커피','원두','드립백'],'쌀':['쌀','백미'],'생수':['생수'],'스파게티':['스파게티','파스타']}\\nWALLET='결제서는 Hermes Shop 지갑 0x593F…F00C로 서명했습니다(에이전트 카드 wallets.shop과 같음).'\\nFOOD='식품의 시장 인증서에는 등급이 없으며 식품 등급은 남은 소비기한을 따릅니다. 안내 등급은 현재 재고 기준입니다.'\\ndef path(a,k,d,testing):\\n p=Path(a.get(k,d))\\n if testing:\\n  if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or p.parts[:2]!=('tmp','test'):raise ValueError('invalid test path')\\n elif str(p)!=d:raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n return p\\ndef stamp(x):\\n try:return float(x or 0)\\n except Exception:\\n  try:return datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(str(x).replace('Z','+00:00')).timestamp()\\n  except Exception:return 0\\ndef log(p,x):\\n p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n with p.open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,default=str)+'\\\\n')\\ndef api(kit,p,body=None):\\n r=httpx.request('POST' if body is not None else 'GET',kit.market.rstrip('/')+p,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},json=body,timeout=8);r.raise_for_status();return r.json()\\ndef settled(x):\\n return isinstance(x,dict) and (x.get('settled') is True or x.get('status')=='settled' or x.get('state')=='settled' or settled(x.get('result')) or settled(x.get('data')))\\ndef requests(text):\\n hits=[]\\n for n,words in ALIASES.items():\\n  for w in words:\\n   for m in re.finditer(re.escape(w),text,re.I):hits.append((m.start(),m.end(),n))\\n hits.sort(key=lambda z:(z[0],z[0]-z[1]));used=[];out=[]\\n for s,e,n in hits:\\n  if any(s<y and e>x for x,y in used):continue\\n  used.append((s,e));tail=text[e:e+30]\\n  if re.match(r'\\\\s*(?:은|는|이|가)?\\\\s*(?:찾는\\\\s*게\\\\s*아니|찾지|말고|아니|안\\\\s*찾|재고\\\\s*확인이\\\\s*안)',tail):continue", "ts": 1795776221}
{"thought": "결제서 선택과 기록 처리의 나머지를 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/logic.py", "offset": 8900, "limit": 9000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"'.join(alts) if alts else ' 현재 판매 가능한 재고가 없습니다.'))\\n   lines.append(WALLET)\\n   if any(u.get('kind')=='food' for x,u in selected):lines.append(FOOD)\\n   r={'reply':'\\\\n'.join(lines),'data':{'checkouts':out},'state':'input_required'}\\n   if len(out)==1:r['data'].update(out[0])\\n  log(lp,{'at':now,'text':text,'data':data,'reply':r['reply'],'response_data':r.get('data'),'task_id':a.get('task_id'),'claimed_from':a.get('claimed_from')});return r\\n except Exception as e:\\n  if lp:\\n   try:log(lp,{'at':now,'text':text,'reply':'재고를 확인하지 못했습니다. 잠시 뒤 다시 문의해 주세요.','error':str(e)})\\n   except Exception:pass\\n  return {'reply':'재고를 확인하지 못했습니다. 잠시 뒤 다시 문의해 주세요.','state':'input_required'}\\n\", \"length\": 9572}}", "ts": 1795776224}
{"thought": "선택 규칙과 서명 본문을 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/logic.py", "offset": 6100, "limit": 3300}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"])==choice]\\n     if picks and (not req or any(matches(n,picks[0][0]) and (not g or g==picks[0][1]['grade']) for n,g in req)):selected.append(picks[0])\\n    for n,g in req:\\n     if any(matches(n,x) and (not g or u.get('grade')==g) for x,u in selected):continue\\n     candidates=[z for z in available if matches(n,z[0]) and (not g or z[1].get('grade')==g) and z[1]['unit'] not in [p[1]['unit'] for p in selected]]\\n     if n=='두부' and re.search('멸균두부.{0,5}(?:제외|말고)|연두부.{0,5}(?:제외|말고)',text):candidates=[z for z in candidates if not re.search('멸균두부|연두부',z[0]['name'])]\\n     if n=='커피' and re.search('드립백|원두',text):candidates=[z for z in candidates if re.search('드립백|원두',z[0]['name'])]\\n     if candidates:selected.append(candidates[0]);continue\\n     held=[u for u in live if matches(n,u) and (not g or u.get('grade')==g)]\\n     if held:unpriced.append(n);continue\\n     missing.append(n+((' '+g+'등급') if g else ''));log(wp,{'at':now,'item':n,'text':text})\\n    out=[];lines=[];no_checkout=bool(re.search('결제서.{0,12}(?:보내지|발급하지|주지)\\\\s*말',text))\\n    for x,u in selected:\\n     ex=stamp(u.get('expires_at'));date=datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp(ex,datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(hours=9))).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M KST') if ex else '표시 없음';remaining=(' (약 %.1f시간 남음)'%((ex-now)/3600)) if ex else '';line='%s / %s등급 / %s credits / 소비기한 %s%s / 보증 %s시간.'%(x['name'],u['grade'],x['price'],date,remaining,x.get('warranty_hours',0))\\n     if '취나물' in x['name'] and re.search('중량|무게|포장량|몇 g',text,re.I) and not re.search(r'\\\\d+\\\\s*(?:g|kg|그램)',x['name'],re.I):line+=' 포장 중량은 확인되지 않았습니다.'\\n     if not no_checkout:\\n      cid=str(uuid.uuid4());task=str(uuid.uuid4());payload={'id':cid,'shop':kit.name,'shop_url':kit.shop_url,'item':x['sku'],'price':x['price'],'task':task,'currency':'credits','iat':int(now),'unit':u['unit'],'cert':u['cert'],'warranty_hours':x.get('warranty_hours',0)};jwt=kit.sign_jwt(payload,'shop');holds[u['unit']]={'expires_at':now+180", "ts": 1795776227}
{"thought": "공급창이 열려 있는지와 주문 규격을 확인합니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "wholesale"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where toke", "ts": 1795776233}
