{"thought": "만료 임박 상품 가격과 조건 불일치 결제서가 병목입니다. 가격 도구의 기존 실패를 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고와 원장 거래 중간가로 만료순 카탈로그를 발행합니다. args: max_loss_per_day, loss_units, catalog_path, reserve_path; 테스트는 tmp/test만 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, loss_reservations.json, loss_reservations.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 10\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@9\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,math,os,re,time,statistics\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef floor(u):\\n c=int(u['cost']);return math.ceil((c+210)*100/99)+math.ceil(c*.005)\\ndef save(p,obj):\\n p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);q=str(p)+'.next'\\n with open(q,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(obj,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n os.replace(q,p)\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=Path(args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'));rp=Path(args.get('reserve_path','loss_reservations.json'))\\n  if kit.testing:\\n   for f in (p,rp):\\n    if not str(f.resolve()).startswith(str(Path('tmp/test').resolve())+os.sep):raise ValueError('test path must be tmp/test')\\n  elif str(p)!='public/catalog.json' or str(rp)!='loss_reservations.json':raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n  try:old=json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8')).get('items',[])\\n  except FileNotFoundError:old=[]\\n  try:reservations=json.loads(rp.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n  except FileNotFoundError:reservations=[]\\n  if not isinstance(reservations,list):raise ValueError('invalid reservations')\\n  if kit.testing:units=args['inventory'];ledger=args['ledger_fixture'];now=args.get('now',time.time())\\n  else:\\n   h={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')};r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers=h,timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();ledger=r.json();now=time.time()\\n  if isinstance", "ts": 1795788598}
{"thought": "정산 및 서명 결제서 계약을 확인한 뒤 안전하게 응대기를 재작성합니다.", "action": "wholesale_card", "args": {"entity": "clearing"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"card\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wal", "ts": 1795788602}
