{"thought": "결제서의 실제 데이터 형식을 확인해 서명과 정산 호환성을 유지합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "search", "word": "checkout_jwt"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"결제서·mandate의 실제 계약을 확인해 기존 정산을 깨뜨리지 않도록 합니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"wholesale_card\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"entity\\\": \\\"clearing\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"card\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4.0.0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Agent Market\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"supportedInterfaces\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolBinding\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MARKET-REST\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolVersion\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"capabilities\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"streaming\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"pushNotifications\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"extensions\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"uri\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"s", "ts": 1795807971}
{"thought": "서명 페이로드와 데이터 반환 형식을 부분 조회합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/logic.py", "offset": 5800, "limit": 11000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"(x,u));break\\n    available.sort(key=lambda z:(stamp(z[1].get('expires_at')) or float('inf'),stamp(z[1].get('supplied_at'))));selected=[];missing=[];unpriced=[];req=requests(text)\\n    if prob>=0.6 and choice and choice!='none':\\n     picks=[z for z in available if str(z[0]['sku'])+':'+str(z[0]['grade'])==choice]\\n     if picks and (not req or any(matches(n,picks[0][0]) and (not g or g==picks[0][1]['grade']) for n,g in req)):selected.append(picks[0])\\n    for n,g in req:\\n     if any(matches(n,x) and (not g or u.get('grade')==g) for x,u in selected):continue\\n     candidates=[z for z in available if matches(n,z[0]) and (not g or z[1].get('grade')==g) and z[1]['unit'] not in [p[1]['unit'] for p in selected]]\\n     if n=='두부' and re.search('멸균두부.{0,5}(?:제외|말고)|연두부.{0,5}(?:제외|말고)',text):candidates=[z for z in candidates if not re.search('멸균두부|연두부',z[0]['name'])]\\n     if n=='커피' and re.search('드립백|원두',text):candidates=[z for z in candidates if re.search('드립백|원두',z[0]['name'])]\\n     if candidates:selected.append(candidates[0]);continue\\n     held=[u for u in live if matches(n,u) and (not g or u.get('grade')==g)]\\n     if held:unpriced.append(n);continue\\n     missing.append(n+((' '+g+'등급') if g else ''));log(wp,{'at':now,'item':n,'text':text})\\n    out=[];lines=[];no_checkout=bool(re.search('결제서.{0,12}(?:보내지|발급하지|주지)\\\\s*말',text))\\n    for x,u in selected:\\n     ex=stamp(u.get('expires_at'));date=datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp(ex,datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(hours=9))).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M KST') if ex else '표시 없음';remaining=(' (약 %.1f시간 남음)'%((ex-now)/3600)) if ex else '';line='%s / %s등급 / %s credits / 소비기한 %s%s / 보증 %s시간.'%(x['name'],u['grade'],x['price'],date,remaining,x.get('warranty_hours',0))\\n     if '취나물' in x['name'] and re.search('중량|무게|포장량|몇 g',text,re.I) and not re.search(r'\\\\d+\\\\s*(?:g|kg|그램)',x['name'],re.I):line+=' 포장 중량은 확인되지 않았습니다.'\\n     if not no_checkout:\\n      cid=str(uuid.uuid4());task=str(u", "ts": 1795807974}
{"thought": "실제 테스트 환경의 서명 검증 방식과 기존 픽스처 계약을 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"mode": "read", "path": "tools/a2a_handler/test.py", "offset": 0, "limit": 18000}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"ok\": true, \"text\": \"import json,time,uuid,base64\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\ndef test(run,kit):\\n root=Path('tmp/test')/uuid.uuid4().hex;root.mkdir(parents=True);now=time.time();goods=[('G001','한계란 난각번호 1번 계란 무항생제 유정란 20구','B',7340),('G002','동서 둥굴레차 50T 60g','B',3051),('G003','실큰두부 300g','B',2793),('G004','국내산 시금치 1kg','B',6000),('G005','[반찬천국] 취나물','B',2374),('G006','총각김치 2kg','C',5827),('G007','요거트 400g','C',6164),('G008','자반고등어 800g','C',4950)];items=[];units=[]\\n for sku,name,g,price in goods:\\n  uid='u-'+sku;items.append({'sku':sku,'name':name,'grade':g,'price':price,'stock':1,'units':[uid],'warranty_hours':0});units.append({'unit':uid,'sku':sku,'name':name,'grade':g,'kind':'food','expires_at':now+10000,'cert':{'cert':{'unit':uid,'grade':None},'sig':'fixture'}})\\n (root/'catalog.json').write_text(json.dumps({'items':items},ensure_ascii=False))\\n messages=[('안녕하세요. 계란이 필요해서요. 한계란 난각번호 1번 계란 무항생제 유정란 20구가 지금 실제 재고인가요?',['G001']),('계란 B등급 결제서 주세요',['G001']),('둥굴레차 B등급은 대안으로 있나요?',['G002']),('두부 B등급 재고 확인해주세요',['G003']),('시금치 B등급 주세요',['G004']),('취나물 B등급 포장 중량과 결제서 부탁합니다',['G005']),('취나물 B등급 재고가 지금 실제로 구매 가능한가요?',['G005']),('취나물 B등급 2,374원 상품 아직 실제 재고 있나요?',['G005']),('총각김치 2kg C등급 인증서에 C등급과 가격이 명시되고 가게 지갑 서명이 검증되는 결제서를 부탁드립니다.',['G006']),('계란과 시금치 구매합니다',['G001','G004']),('계란과 두부 부탁드려요',['G001','G003']),('아이들 아침용 우유와 요거트가 필요해요. 두유는 찾는 게 아니고',['G007']),('고등어 등급과 가격 결제서 주세요',['G008']),('취나물이나 시금치 실재고 있나요',['G005','G004']),('두부 B등급과 둥굴레차 B등급 결제서 주세요',['G003','G002'])]\\n for i,(text,expected) in enumerate(messages):\\n  a={'text':text,'catalog_path':str(root/'catalog.json'),'holds_path':str(root/('h%d.json'%i)),'customers_path':str(root/'customers.jsonl'),'wanted_path':str(root/'wanted.jsonl'),'inventory_fixture':{'units':units},'decision_fixture':{'answers':[{'choice':'none','probability':1}]}};r=run(a,kit);out=r['data']['checkouts'];assert set(x['sku'] for x in out)==set(expected),(text,r)\\n  for c in out:\\n   assert c['name'] in r['reply'] ", "ts": 1795807977}
